description = "hakuX-lr is an original Xbox emulator for Linux x86-64, Linux ARM64 and Android ARM64. Uses Vulkan graphics and requires no BIOS, MCPX ROM or hard disk image."
notes = "(!) Requires RetroArch's vulkan video driver and Vulkan 1.2 or newer (1.3 recommended).|Linux x86-64 requires Linux 5.16+, access to /dev/kvm, TSC scaling and UMIP.|Android ARM64 requires Android 9 (API 28) or newer.|Game saves and caches are stored in hdd/ and cache/ under RetroArch's save directory.|Start Core (no content) boots the Xbox dashboard installed in hdd/Partition2.|Save states, rewind and run-ahead are not supported."
